        <mxCell id="c39" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;b&gt;PING&lt;/b&gt; (not a state): send PING every 3s while a session exists (WAIT_FRAME / STREAMING / RECOVERING; not in WAITING). PONG changes no state and does not reset the FRAME timer (checking its sequence is optional).&lt;br&gt;(*) Also from WAIT_FRAME / RECOVERING → WAITING. Any valid ERROR for the session counts, whatever its text. The receiver-side lease_ms check is optional (the sample does it)." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="104" width="400" x="609" y="927" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c40" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;b&gt;Variable mode only&lt;/b&gt;: FRAME with unknown schema_id → skip + GET_SCHEMA (max 1/s). Old / duplicate FRAME sequence: skip. STOP is sent on deliberate exit from any state with a session, never because retries ran out." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="66" width="400" x="609" y="1039" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
